//! HDS-5 worked examples: published answers with their page and tolerance, in US units.
//!
//! Appendix rows check the dimensionless equations. Design rows check headwater, critical
//! depth and full-barrel loss H. `within` records whether the 100-digit equation value lies
//! within `tolerance` of the published value. Rows outside it are published errors or
//! HY-8 polynomial fits, and a check skips them.

